{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamintro-ph.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamact.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart and overpower your opponents in a series of turn-based duels, master the three great actions in the wild game of intelligence, skill, trickery and luck. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A TRICK UP YOUR SLEEVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamitem.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend the rules of the game to your will with various items that you unlock throughout the game. Be thoughtful of what and when you use - it can cost you your life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GET RIGHT BACK INTO ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamback.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is not the end - go back to the game almost instantly, don't let the night go silent. Don't be afraid to risk, embrace the rush you get from rolling the dice of life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MAKE IT TO THE TOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamworld.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become \u21161 in this god forsaken, ice-cold bar in the middle of nowhere, where even the night sky stars can't shine through the endless blizzard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625390?t=1746351428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/9a70138c05de8e7362b33ebabf9e1954b7cbeaeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746351428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/de94a67a79d7bf84ab4f1b4fa605142c73a37267/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746351428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/de94a67a79d7bf84ab4f1b4fa605142c73a37267/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746351428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3628980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO POLAR STAR, WHERE THE MUSIC OF LOUD GUNSHOTS NEVER STOPS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625390/extras/steamintro-ph.gif?t=1746351428\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way to the top in a deadly tournament of turn-based duels, break the game rules by unlocking various items that turn the power balance upside-down. Calculate all possible outcomes and carefully plan your moves, or just give into the rush and relentlessly gamble with your life on the line.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOOT, DRINK, PREPARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 